{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/ba1236c2d3f94badf47c25f6cd28f150.poster.avif?t=1765297362\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/ba1236c2d3f94badf47c25f6cd28f150.webm?t=1765297362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/ba1236c2d3f94badf47c25f6cd28f150.mp4?t=1765297362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GAME OF CHANCE, A TEST OF SKILL</strong></h2>Lost in Random: The Eternal Die blends dynamic real-time action, tactical combat, and risk-reward dice mechanics for thrilling second-to-second battles. <br><br>Unravel an original stand-alone story as Queen Aleksandra, the once great ruler of Random on a mission for vengeance and redemption. <br><br>Wield an arsenal of four unique weapons, unleash powerful card-based abilities, harness elemental relics and strategically roll your trusted die-companion, Fortune, to shift the tide of battle. Or take on high-stakes wager games where the right roll could lead to incredible rewards\u2026 or crushing consequences. <br><br>Even death isn\u2019t final - return to the Sanctuary to unlock new weapons, buy powerful upgrades, and take on quests from your allies to prepare for your next run.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DARK FANTASY BROUGHT TO LIFE</strong></h2>Explore four dynamic biomes, each teeming with danger, secrets, and unpredictable challenges. Lose yourself in a haunting world of gothic whimsy, vivid landscapes, and an enchantingly atmospheric soundtrack.<br><br>With alternative endings to discover and a fully voiced cast of quirky characters, The Eternal Die invites you back into the world of Random for another unforgettable chapter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/0a29e0d0d9600c9d738583c62c13b91b.poster.avif?t=1765297362\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/0a29e0d0d9600c9d738583c62c13b91b.webm?t=1765297362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/0a29e0d0d9600c9d738583c62c13b91b.mp4?t=1765297362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced, second-to-second combat that blends real-time action with tactical decision-making.<br></li><li>A unique dice-roll mechanic that shifts battles in unexpected ways.<br></li><li>Four diverse and fully upgradeable weapons each with distinct playstyles.<br></li><li>100+ elemental relics and 15 powerful card-based abilities to customise your build.<br></li><li>Four randomly-generated biomes filled with secrets, enemies, and high-stakes challenges.<br></li><li>30+ unique enemy types and 4 ruthless world bosses, each demanding skill and strategy.<br></li><li>Randomly generated encounters, evolving relic synergies, and adjustable difficulty settings let you play your way.<br></li><li>A dark fantasy world brought to life in a Burtonesque style featuring hauntingly beautiful environments and an enchanting soundtrack. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/26fd064fa7aa9ae9ea90e2238784bcc4.poster.avif?t=1765297362\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/26fd064fa7aa9ae9ea90e2238784bcc4.webm?t=1765297362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/extras/26fd064fa7aa9ae9ea90e2238784bcc4.mp4?t=1765297362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Square One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/113ac3248fc7c2284728122fdd5938e05004a3f0.jpg"},{"name":"Sibling Rivalry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/a3f3b53531120b78dcb57a8e33bcb65d794e085c.jpg"},{"name":"Croaked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/aa3aaa2924b69c24a80f9cfc30a91c5ecb931836.jpg"},{"name":"Factory Reset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/261c1762ec91c5905653c3c05e9b6c876a407762.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer the Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/78e2c91a0ed595c956348962b75b8020e6613aad.jpg"},{"name":"Racking Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/5cb48b3c9d5b5e2dbae13803141b3ebe715446b7.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Stocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/ca7d471a47565a46525da8f4fd113835454130d3.jpg"},{"name":"Counting Blessings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/c2cf79e3c119d17dac9bbd1c89506d447848bf7e.jpg"},{"name":"Peak Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/41c75a1e21f88b422ee82a5c39852181c8402b75.jpg"},{"name":"A Head of the Rack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2564520/94576fc42be6d82514fbb802b145860bad86edd7.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2564520?t=1765297362","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564520/fc5274001fc22eef2ca6248acfee1cb38e89ad8c/page_